sequenceDiagram
  actor U as 사용자
  participant UI as MainActivity
  participant C as IntegratedConsentSession
  participant D as 민감 저장
  participant P as Process coordinator
  participant S as Privacy Gateway
  U->>UI: 목적 선택 false
  UI->>D: local withdrawal marker commit
  UI->>C: withdrawImmediately
  C-->>UI: effective deny
  UI->>UI: 해당 RAW·자동신고·cellular·학습 중단
  UI->>C: pending mutation admission
  C->>D: client revision과 pending commit
  alt 저장 실패
    C-->>UI: failClosed
  else 저장 성공
    UI->>S: PUT choices와 previous receipt
    alt 정확한 newer confirmation
      S-->>UI: requestId·revision·receipt
      UI->>P: withCurrentGeneralSession
      P->>D: confirmation 저장 후 exact pending 제거
      P->>C: authority guard와 apply
    else 409 previous receipt conflict
      S-->>UI: 확정 거절
      UI->>S: bootstrap CURRENT_CONSENT
      S-->>UI: floor와 현재 receipt
      UI->>D: 누적 denials 보존 successor와 CAS journal
      UI->>S: 자동 복구 최대 1회
    else 결과 불명 또는 네트워크 실패
      UI->>C: PENDING_RETRY
      C-->>UI: local deny 유지·새 grant 제한
    end
  end
